invalid type: string "5-6\nThe rationale is informed by the content of the module as well as further \nresearch to make the best possible design decisions.\n7-9\nPerformance 8\nThe code does not run, the robot does not move, or there are other \nobvious flaws such as assuming the position of the obstacles or objects \nto interact with (this does not include walls or tables).\n0-1\nnpline:\n any \n